00:25:33,780 --> 00:25:46,640
Parents and caregivers with children ages 2 1⁄2 to 5 from Atkinson-Danville and Sandown and Plastow are invited to take part in this fun and engaging weekly play-to-learn program.

171
00:25:46,880 --> 00:25:55,440
Enjoy special time playing and learning with your child while discovering simple, effective ways to build early learning and school readiness skills.

172
00:25:55,440 --> 00:26:04,060
You will also pick up helpful tips from our parent support sessions and activities to support your child's growth at home.

173
00:26:05,260 --> 00:26:18,200
So these are kids that are part of the TRSD community, and these are for kids that aren't yet part of the community,

174
00:26:18,200 --> 00:26:31,840
