AND DRIVES, ALONG WITH REPLACING THE AGED ROOFING SECTIONS LOCATED DIRECTLY BENEATH THE AHU-1 UNIT.

936
01:09:47,680 --> 01:09:56,680
AND LASTLY AT THE TIMBERLAINE MIDDLE SCHOOL, WE'RE DOING A COMPLETE REPLACEMENT OF AIR HANDLE-3,

937
01:09:56,680 --> 01:10:05,680
AIR HANDLE-7, AIR HANDLE-9, AC-UNIT-1, AND ER-U-9.

