01:10:16,680 --> 01:10:24,680
ANYBODY HAVE ANY QUESTIONS ABOUT THE SUMMARY OF WORK THAT'S BEEN COMPLETED AND IS GOING TO BE COMING UP NEXT?

942
01:10:24,680 --> 01:10:25,680
SEAN.

943
01:10:25,680 --> 01:10:27,680
THANK YOU FOR THAT, MARK.

944
01:10:27,680 --> 01:10:33,680
I SEE THAT WE'VE DONE A TON OF THESE ERUs, THE HANDLERS, ALL THAT KIND OF STUFF.

945
01:10:33,680 --> 01:10:36,680
WHO'S DOING THE MAINTENANCE OF THESE ONGOING?

