01:18:50,680 --> 01:18:55,680
THE IMPACT TO STAFF AND TO STUDENTS IN A BETTER LEARNING ENVIRONMENT.

1048
01:18:55,680 --> 01:18:59,680
AND, AGAIN, I GO BACK TO THE BELFRY, I JUST DON'T KNOW HOW THAT DIDN'T FALL ON SOMEBODY.

1049
01:18:59,680 --> 01:19:05,680
SO IT'S SAFER, IT'S A BETTER LEARNING ENVIRONMENT, AND THAT HAS VALUE.

1050
01:19:05,680 --> 01:19:10,680
