1051
01:19:10,680 --> 01:19:13,680
VALUE IS UP 40% PROFICIENCY TO, LIKE, 80%.

1052
01:19:13,680 --> 01:19:14,680
THAT'S WHERE WE SHOULD BE.

1053
01:19:14,680 --> 01:19:15,680
YEAH.

1054
01:19:15,680 --> 01:19:16,680
THANK YOU.

