YES.

1059
01:19:23,680 --> 01:19:24,680
ALL RIGHT.

1060
01:19:24,680 --> 01:19:25,680
AWESOME.

1061
01:19:25,680 --> 01:19:36,680
SO ON TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 15TH, WE HAD OUR FACILITIES MEETING TO DISCUSS THE HIGH SCHOOL ENVELOPE PROJECT WITH THE BANWELL ARCHITECTS AND EEI.

1062
01:19:36,680 --> 01:19:51,680
BANWELL HAS PROVIDED EI WITH A BITTABLE SET OF CONSTRUCTION DRAWINGS AND SPECIFICATIONS, WHICH THEY WILL BE WORKING ON OVER THE NEXT MONTH TO PUT PRICING TOGETHER.

1063
01:19:51,680 --> 01:20:14,680
AND ON OCTOBER 14TH, FACILITIES EXPECTS TO RECEIVE THE, WE'RE GOING TO RECEIVE A BASE PRICE TO INCLUDE 75-25 SPLIT BETWEEN ALUMINUM PANELS AND ALUMINUM PLANKING WITH AN OPTION A, WHICH WILL INCLUDE A SPLIT INVOLVING MORE PLANKING AT AN UNDETERMINED PERCENTAGE AS OF RIGHT NOW.

1064
01:20:14,680 --> 01:20:24,680
AND THEN FACILITIES PLANS TO PRESENT THE PRICING TO THE SCHOOL BOARD ON THE, AT THE OCTOBER 15TH MEETING.

1065
01:20:24,680 --> 01:20:29,680
ANYBODY THAN FACILITIES WANT TO ADD ON TO THAT?

1066
01:20:29,680 --> 01:20:32,680
THAT WAS A REAL READERS' DIGEST VERSION. WELL DONE.

1067
01:20:32,680 --> 01:20:34,680
HOURS AND HOURS OF DISCUSSIONS.

1068
01:20:34,680 --> 01:20:35,680
YOU DIDN'T EVEN...

