01:20:35,680 --> 01:20:37,680
I WOULD HAVE DRESSED IT UP ALSO.

1070
01:20:37,680 --> 01:20:40,680
IT WAS ONLY TWO HOURS LONG, RIGHT, THE MEETING?

1071
01:20:40,680 --> 01:20:43,680
THERE WAS A LOGIC TREE THAT KEPT ON GROWING.

1072
01:20:43,680 --> 01:20:45,680
SO YOU DID A GREAT JOB OF THE SYNOMSIS.

1073
01:20:45,680 --> 01:20:52,680
WE'RE ALSO TALKING AND LOOKING AT THREE DIFFERENT WINDOW PRICING WITH DIFFERENT PRICING FOR THE INSIDE OF THE WINDOW,

1074
01:20:52,680 --> 01:20:54,680
TRYING TO FIGURE OUT THE MOST COST-EFFECTIVE, REASONABLE WAY.

1075
01:20:54,680 --> 01:20:58,680
INDIVIDUAL UNIT PRICING FOR THE WINDOWS THAT DO NEED TO BE REPLACED.

